WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.776
Welcome to Sprint Two.

2
00:00:01.791 --> 00:00:05.954
Now that you've framed a
problem, it's time to ask whether

3
00:00:05.969 --> 00:00:07.530
it's worth pursuing.

4
00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.136
Your first idea is a starting point.

5
00:00:10.151 --> 00:00:14.133
In this sprint, you'll look more
closely at the assumptions behind

6
00:00:14.148 --> 00:00:18.110
it, the solutions that already
exist, and what change would ask

7
00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:19.530
of the people involved.

8
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.150
Use your own reasoning
to weigh those questions.

9
00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:27.973
AI can help you explore another
perspective, while the judgment stays

10
00:00:27.988 --> 00:00:31.880
yours. By the end, you'll be
able to explain why you're

11
00:00:31.895 --> 00:00:35.290
continuing, changing direction,
or setting the problem aside.

12
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:40.585
A better decision is progress, even
when the original idea changes.

13
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.890
Let's get started.
